# iOS workspace boundary

This repository is **marine-weather-ios** — the Apple platform app only.

## Do NOT modify (unless the user explicitly asks in a separate message about Android)

- `/Users/Safelight/Veneappi` (Android Gradle project, Play Console release)
- `fi.veneappi.app` Android manifests, Compose UI (`VeneappiRoot`, `MapPane`, `RoutePane`, etc.)
- Google Play signing, `keystore.properties`, `friends` build type

## Do work here

- `/Users/Safelight/marine-weather-ios` (Swift, SwiftUI, Xcode, App Store)
- Shared **docs** may reference Android as a porting source — read-only from `../Veneappi/docs/` if needed, do not edit Android files.

## Product parity (target)

- **Free:** map & weather compare, storm radar, marine text summaries
- **Premium:** route planning + 12-day wind outlook (StoreKit 2)
- **Devices:** iPad, landscape-first (iPhone out of scope for v1 unless user requests)
- **Locale:** English default; FI/SV/NB later

## Stack

- Swift 5.9+, SwiftUI, MapLibre Native iOS (SPM)
- No Kotlin, no Compose, no Gradle in this repo
